  "prefLabel": "Plc 1605.04 Information Required for Registration Renewal Application",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1605.04 Information Required for Registration Renewal Application. In addition to the information required by Plc 308.06, the applicant for renewal of a nurse agency registration shall provide the following information:\n\n(a) The estimated number of licensed medical personnel the applicant expects to have available for assignments to clients, as a range and as an average.\n\nSource. #13914, eff 5-6-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1600.html"
